{"about_the_game":"\u201cHold On&quot; is a multi type game. You can take it as a battle stategy game.Building walls to defend against the enemy's attack,enhance your troops and invade castles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949210/extras/8d8c59b27a53fa2769eb77d401a07cd3.poster.avif?t=1698128790\" width=432 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949210/extras/8d8c59b27a53fa2769eb77d401a07cd3.webm?t=1698128790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949210/extras/8d8c59b27a53fa2769eb77d401a07cd3.mp4?t=1698128790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Or you can take it as a casual game.Build interesting towns and environments and change their styles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949210/extras/8350075a31d9f7bae0d128184acfc29b.poster.avif?t=1698128790\" width=432 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949210/extras/8350075a31d9f7bae0d128184acfc29b.webm?t=1698128790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949210/extras/8350075a31d9f7bae0d128184acfc29b.mp4?t=1698128790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game provides the function of making levels, so that everyone can create their own exclusive levels, including terrain, architecture, environment, troops and enemies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949210/extras/77645acaa0f3b6ef3f5622d7de782738.poster.avif?t=1698128790\" width=432 height=240 ><source src=\"